ects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Faction:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/chaosium\" class=\"entity-link\">Chaosium</a>\n            — <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/chaosium\" class=\"entity-link\">Chaosium</a> publishes Call of Cthulhu.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Creator:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/sandy-petersen\" class=\"entity-link\">Sandy Petersen</a>\n            — Petersen designed Call of Cthulhu.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Concept:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/investigator\" class=\"entity-link\">Investigator</a>\n            — Players take the role of investigators.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Concept:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/keeper\" class=\"entity-link\">Keeper</a>\n            — The <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/keeper\" class=\"entity-link\">Keeper</a> runs Call of Cthulhu games.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Concept:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/lovecraft-mythos\" class=\"entity-link\">Cthulhu Mythos</a>\n            — The RPG adapts Lovecraft&#039;s Mythos.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Concept:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/sanity\" class=\"entity-link\">Sanity</a>\n            — <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/sanity\" class=\"entity-link\">Sanity</a> rules define CoC horror.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Work:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/call-of-cthulhu-seventh-edition\" class=\"entity-link\">Call of Cthulhu 7th Edition</a>\n            — 7th Edition is the current core rules.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Topic:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/tabletop\" class=\"entity-link\">Call